{"version":1,"content":"<p>據《金融時報》報道，儘管科技股近期遭遇大幅拋售，人工智能公司Anthropic仍在推進首次公開募股（IPO），計劃在美國感恩節前上市，尋求融資800億至1000億美元，目標估值為1.25萬億至1.75萬億美元。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585442.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.662823+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T07:46:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"601d9bc2539f41cad07320e92c0ad619a1f00ad76ed71b15ece7944aa4c51aac","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}